OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's bid to bring Europe trains
OL,4,Ato Stratford
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to bring international rail
OL,7,Fservices to Stratford International
OL,8,Fstation have been backed by the mayor
OL,9,Fof London, who says the move could
OL,10,Fboost jobs, investment and tourism in
OL,11,Feast London.
OL,13,FFor the past two decades, passengers
OL,14,Ftravelling to Paris by train have
OL,15,Fdeparted from St Pancras International.
OL,16,FLord Khan wants Stratford International
OL,17,Fto live up to its name, with trains to
OL,18,FEurope stopping there for the first
OL,19,Ftime.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
