OL,3,GNEWSAMayor's bid to bring Europe trains
OL,4,Ato Stratford
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mayor described Stratford as "one
OL,7,Fof Europe's largest and most successful
OL,8,Fregeneration projects" and said
OL,9,Finternational services would help
OL,10,Funlock the station's potential.
OL,12,FThe project is estimated to cost #20m
OL,13,Fwith a decision on funding expected in
OL,14,FWednesday's Budget.
